# ESLint cache. `npm run lint` is a bare `eslint`, and ESLint deletes a stale
# cache file when caching is off, so a tracked one reappears as a deletion for
# everyone who runs the gate. It also trips `design-lint --since`, which
# refuses on a dirty tree. Untracked here; see the PR for the measurement.
.eslintcache
